543
00:55:18.990 --> 00:55:21.618
<i>And four days without sleeping.</i>

544
00:55:21.792 --> 00:55:24.659
<i>What kept me going was</i>
<i>the promise of meeting the girl...</i>

545
00:55:24.829 --> 00:55:26.091
<i>...who would be my wife.</i>

546
00:55:33.804 --> 00:55:36.238
