556
00:56:15.646 --> 00:56:18.012
<i>...about the woman of my dreams.</i>

557
00:56:18.182 --> 00:56:21.117
Enjoy yourselves, enjoy yourselves.

558
00:56:21.285 --> 00:56:22.775
She's going to college.

559
00:56:23.187 --> 00:56:27.453
College. She's going to college.

560
00:56:38.002 --> 00:56:39.469
She likes music.

561
00:56:40.171 --> 00:56:43.937
Music. She likes music.

562
00:56:48.212 --> 00:56:50.314
<i>Over the months, I learned a lot</i>
<i>about the woman I would marry...</i>

563
00:56:50.314 --> 00:56:51.115
<i>Over the months, I learned a lot</i>
<i>about the woman I would marry...</i>

564
00:56:51.115 --> 00:56:51.616
<i>Over the months, I learned a lot</i>
<i>about the woman I would marry...</i>

565
00:56:51.616 --> 00:56:52.617
<i>Over the months, I learned a lot</i>
<i>about the woman I would marry...</i>

566
00:56:52.617 --> 00:56:55.319
<i>...but not her name,</i>
<i>and not where to find her.</i>

567
00:56:56.153 --> 00:57:00.920
<i>That time had come.</i>
<i>I couldn't wait any longer.</i>

568
00:57:12.203 --> 00:57:14.501
