I need to talk to you.

570
00:57:24.115 --> 00:57:26.515
Mr. Calloway?

571
00:58:00.317 --> 00:58:01.682
No. Wait!

572
00:58:19.804 --> 00:58:24.400
<i>That night, I discovered that most</i>
<i>things you consider evil or wicked...</i>

573
00:58:24.575 --> 00:58:28.477
<i>...are simply lonely and lacking</i>
<i>in social niceties.</i>

574
