583
00:59:47.892 --> 00:59:50.019
...is Sandra Templeton.

584
00:59:52.129 --> 00:59:54.791
She goes to Auburn.

585
00:59:55.232 --> 00:59:59.566
Semester's almost over,
so you better hurry.

586
00:59:59.737 --> 01:00:01.466
Thank you. Thank you.

587
01:00:02.039 --> 01:00:04.564
-Good luck, kid!
-Thank you, sir!

588
01:00:17.087 --> 01:00:19.681
-Bye, now.
-Bye, Edward.

589
01:00:21.091 --> 01:00:24.492
<i>After saying my goodbyes,</i>
<i>I hopped three trains...</i>

590
01:00:24.662 --> 01:00:28.063
<i>...to get to Auburn that afternoon.</i>

591
01:01:03.234 --> 01:01:06.897
You don't know me,
but my name is Edward Bloom...

592
01:01:07.071 --> 01:01:08.470
...and I love you.

593
01:01:10.341 --> 01:01:14.072
I've spent the last three years
working to find out who you are.

594
01:01:14.245 --> 01:01:18.545
I've been shot, stabbed, and trampled
a few times. I broke my ribs twice.

595
01:01:19.016 --> 01:01:22.042
But it's all been worth it
to see you here now...

596
01:01:22.219 --> 01:01:25.188
...and to finally get to talk to you.

597
01:01:25.356 --> 01:01:27.722
Because I'm destined to marry you.

598
01:01:28.592 --> 01:01:33.928
I knew it when I saw you at the circus,
and I know it now more than ever.

599
01:01:36.100 --> 01:01:39.501
-I'm sorry.
-You don't have to apologize to me.

600
01:01:39.670 --> 01:01:42.002
I'm the luckiest person
you'll find today.

601
01:01:42.172 --> 01:01:45.300
No, I'm sorry I'm engaged
to be married.

602
01:01:52.483 --> 01:01:55.646
But you're wrong. I do know you.

603
01:01:55.819 --> 01:01:57.787
At least by reputation.

604
01:01:58.722 --> 01:02:01.122
Edward Bloom from Ashton.

605
01:02:01.659 --> 01:02:06.028
See, I'm actually engaged
to a boy from Ashton. Don Price.

606
01:02:06.730 --> 01:02:09.255
